  "en": "<section class=\"cg-directory\" id=\"field-guides\" aria-labelledby=\"cg-directory-title\"><div class=\"cg-section-heading\"><p class=\"cg-eyebrow\">ORBITLIGHT · Constellation field guides</p><h2 id=\"cg-directory-title\">Constellation field guides</h2><p>20 starting points for exploring the sky: recognise the pattern, identify its stars and choose an observing target.</p></div><div class=\"cg-directory-grid\"><a class=\"cg-directory-card\" href=\"/en/constellations/ursa-major\"><img src=\"/constellations/ursa-major-en.svg\" width=\"800\" height=\"520\" alt=\"Constellation finder chart Ursa Major\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><p class=\"cg-eyebrow\">UMa · Ursa Major</p><h3>Ursa Major</h3><p>Spring evenings; the Dipper is also visible in other seasons</p><span class=\"cg-card-link\">How to find it ↗</span></div></a><a class=\"cg-directory-card\" href=\"/en/constellations/cassiopeia\"><img src=\"/constellations/cassiopeia-en.svg\" width=\"800\" height=\"520\" alt=\"Constellation finder chart Cassiopeia\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><p class=\"cg-eyebrow\">Cas · Cassiopeia</p><h3>Cassiopeia</h3><p>Autumn and winter evenings</p><span class=\"cg-card-link\">How to find it ↗</span></div></a><a class=\"cg-directory-card\" href=\"/en/constellations/orion\"><img src=\"/constellations/orion-en.svg\" width=\"800\" height=\"520\" alt=\"Constellation finder chart Orion\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><p class=\"cg-eyebrow\">Ori · Orion</p><h3>Orion</h3><p>Winter evenings; late at night in late autumn</p><span class=\"cg-card-link\">How to find it ↗</span></div></a><a class=\"cg-directory-card\" href=\"/en/constellations/cygnus\"><img src=\"/constellations/cygnus-en.svg\" width=\"800\" height=\"520\" alt=\"Constellation finder chart Cygnus\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><p class=\"cg-eyebrow\">Cyg · Cygnus</p><h3>Cygnus</h3><p>Summer and early autumn evenings</p><span class=\"cg-card-link\">How to find it ↗</span></div></a><a class=\"cg-directory-card\" href=\"/en/constellations/leo\"><img src=\"/constellations/leo-en.svg\" width=\"800\" height=\"520\" alt=\"Constellation finder chart Leo\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><p class=\"cg-eyebrow\">Leo · Leo</p><h3>Leo</h3><p>Spring evenings, especially March to May</p><span class=\"cg-card-link\">How to find it ↗</span></div></a><a class=\"cg-directory-card\" href=\"/en/constellations/scorpius\"><img src=\"/constellations/scorpius-en.svg\" width=\"800\" height=\"520\" alt=\"Constellation finder chart Scorpius\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><p class=\"cg-eyebrow\">Sco · Scorpius</p><h3>Scorpius</h3><p>Short summer nights; an open southern horizon is essential</p><span class=\"cg-card-link\">How to find it ↗</span></div></a><a class=\"cg-directory-card\" href=\"/en/constellations/lyra\"><img src=\"/constellations/lyra-en.svg\" width=\"800\" height=\"520\" alt=\"Constellation finder chart Lyra\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><p class=\"cg-eyebrow\">Lyr · Lyra</p><h3>Lyra</h3><p>Summer and early autumn evenings</p><span class=\"cg-card-link\">How to find it ↗</span></div></a><a class=\"cg-directory-card\" href=\"/en/constellations/andromeda\"><img src=\"/constellations/andromeda-en.svg\" width=\"800\" height=\"520\" alt=\"Constellation finder chart Andromeda\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><p class=\"cg-eyebrow\">And · Andromeda</p><h3>Andromeda</h3><p>Autumn evenings and early winter</p><span class=\"cg-card-link\">How to find it ↗</span></div></a><a class=\"cg-directory-card\" href=\"/en/constellations/ursa-minor\"><img src=\"/constellations/ursa-minor-en.svg\" width=\"800\" height=\"520\" alt=\"Constellation finder chart Ursa Minor\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><p class=\"cg-eyebrow\">UMi · Ursa Minor</p><h3>Ursa Minor</h3><p>Year-round; long dark nights help reveal the fainter stars</p><span class=\"cg-card-link\">How to find it ↗</span></div></a><a class=\"cg-directory-card\" href=\"/en/constellations/draco\"><img src=\"/constellations/draco-en.svg\" width=\"800\" height=\"520\" alt=\"Constellation finder chart Draco\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><p cla